From 4d50f8c6e6a9fda4812c413e0aabb546bbbe9ed3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: rstmcsoch <300077786+rstmcsoch@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 02:28:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Complete Dio system: admin management UI, profile
 balance/history, material & portal pricing fields
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Admin → Dio tab with five panels: Overview (wallet totals, earned/spent
  today & week, unlocks, ad completions, most-expensive & most-unlocked,
  pending-review CTA); Users (debounced name/email search, highest/lowest
  ranking, Credit/Debit/Gift modal with current→after preview, reason +
  confirmation, negative-balance protection, History deep-link);
  Transactions (filters by user/type/source/min-amount/date range +
  detail modal with idempotency reference and before/after balances);
  EarnDio Ads (create/edit offers, reward, manual-review vs signed-postback
  verification, active toggle, window dates, order, per-ad stats;
  deactivation preserves history); Review (manual-verification queue,
  approve awards via the same idempotent atomic path / reject).
- Materials/Portals admin editors: editable Dio cost (0 = free) + gold cost
  chips; price changes never affect existing unlocks.
- Profile: ✦ balance chip bottom-right of the profile card linking to
  /earnDio + 'Dio history' section (signed amounts, reason, relative dates,
  resulting balance).

Verified: tsc clean, vite build clean, 48/48 executable Postgres tests
(PGlite) for wallet init, guest walls, insufficient balance, exactly-once
unlock/re-click, ad award replay-safety, ledger immutability,
balance==SUM(ledger), RLS tamper walls, admin views, price permanence.

Co-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>
